DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Paris:20261013T083000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Paris:20261014T160000
SUMMARY:NTN Days 2026
DESCRIPTION:NTN Days 2026\, the event dedicated to Non-Terrestrial Netwo
 rks\, bringing together academic and industrial communities working on t
 he challenges of non-terrestrial connectivity\, from the physical layer
 to networking and standardization.\n\nTwo keynotes\, four technical sess
 ions\, a poster session and a roundtable.\nFull program: https://ntndays
 .space/#program
LOCATION:Cnam\, 292 Rue Saint-Martin\, 75003 Paris\, France
URL:https://ntndays.space/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
