 uis Barbier (ISAE-SUPAERO): SatComTopology and SatGoNetEm\, a flexible p
 latform for dynamic satellite-network experimentation\n11:00 Bastien Tau
 ran (Viveris Technologies): CERES\, a satellite constellation network em
 ulator\n11:15 Juan A. Fraire (Inria\, INSA Lyon): Ungrounded computing i
 n low-Earth orbit
